# Data
# The identity DB holds the ONLY login -> actor_hash mapping in the system.
# It must never be committed. Listed explicitly as well as by glob so the
# rule is greppable, not inferred.
data/identity.db
data/*.db
*.db
*.sqlite3
pgdata/

